Replace ALL occurrences of `JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, document.RootElement)` with `document.RootElement.WriteTo(writer)` across the entire project. The `JsonElement.WriteTo(Utf8JsonWriter)` method is AOT-safe and does exactly the same thing.

